{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着蘋果首款摺疊屏手機 iPhone Duo 即將正式上市，隱藏在其 7.6 英寸內屏下方的 FaceTime 前置攝像頭成為外界關注的焦點。這是蘋果首次在量產設備中採用屏下攝像頭技術，但與設備上的其他攝像頭相比，蘋果披露的信息明顯更為有限。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583260.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.527698+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:00:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"72d6a3938b696eb9b4a5377061f9138231c90206b3159b0cf901a396131f36ac","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}